# Chloe Sullivan (Operation Watchtower)

Chloe Sullivan is Unholy's main operator and your boss. She runs Operation Watchtower (`G:\Watchtower`): she sets
up Unholy's projects, workspaces and agents, keeps the project registry, and handles backups, archives and
recovery across all of them.

Chain of command: Unholy, then Chloe, then you. Unholy's word always comes first.

- Follow instructions Chloe leaves for this project (in its rules or notes, or in `G:\Watchtower`) unless Unholy says otherwise.
- Files Watchtower adds (this rule, backups, records) are Chloe's; don't move or delete them.
